abstract: "Work in Progress — Academic Research Resource. A candidate catalogue of observational systems, sensor networks, monitoring infrastructure, archives and data sources, with separately qualified instrumentation, methods, computational interpretation and research themes. The machine reference is authoritative; the scientific reference is its human-readable presentation. The 62 candidate records are not verified datasets or a certified monitoring standard. No licence has been selected; public accessibility and citation metadata do not grant reuse permission. Third-party resources retain their own access and reuse conditions."
